#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:8
msgid "Memory Model"
msgstr "内存模型"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:10
msgid ""
"cuTile's memory model permits the compiler and hardware to reorder "
"operations for performance. Without explicit synchronization, the "
"ordering of memory accesses across |blocks| is not guaranteed."
msgstr "cuTile 的内存模型允许编译器和硬件出于性能考虑重排操作。如果没有显式同步，跨 |blocks| 的内存访问顺序无法得到保证。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:14
msgid ""
"To coordinate memory accesses between |blocks|, cuTile provides two "
"attributes for atomic operations:"
msgstr "为了协调 |blocks| 之间的内存访问，cuTile 为原子操作提供了两个属性："

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Memory Order** --- defines the ordering semantics of an atomic "
"operation."
msgstr "**内存序（Memory Order）** --- 定义原子操作的排序语义。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Memory Scope** --- defines the set of |blocks| that participate in "
"ordering."
msgstr "**内存作用域（Memory Scope）** --- 定义参与排序的 |blocks| 集合。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:20
msgid ""
"Synchronization operates at per-element granularity: each element in the "
"array participates independently in the memory model."
msgstr "同步以逐元素粒度生效：数组中的每个元素都独立参与内存模型约束。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:23
msgid ""
"For further details, see the Memory Model section of the `Tile IR "
"documentation <https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/tile-ir/>`_."
msgstr ""
"更多细节请参阅 `Tile IR 文档 <https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/tile-ir/>`_ 中的 Memory "
"Model 章节。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:28
msgid "Memory Order"
msgstr "内存序"

#: cuda.tile._memory_model.MemoryOrder:1 of
msgid "Memory ordering semantics of a memory operation."
msgstr "内存操作的内存排序语义。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryOrder.WEAK:1 of
msgid "Weak (non-atomic) ordering. The default for load/store operations."
msgstr "弱序（非原子序）。load/store 操作的默认设置。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryOrder.RELAXED:1 of
msgid "No ordering guarantees. Cannot be used to synchronize between threads."
msgstr "不提供排序保证，不能用于线程间同步。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryOrder.ACQUIRE:1 of
msgid ""
"Acquire semantics. When this reads a value written by a release, the "
"releasing thread's prior writes become visible. Subsequent reads/writes "
"within the same block cannot be reordered before this operation."
msgstr ""
"获取语义（Acquire）。当该操作读取到由发布（release）操作写入的值时，发布线程此前的写操作会变为可见。同一 block "
"内后续的读/写操作不能被重排到此操作之前。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryOrder.RELEASE:1 of
msgid ""
"Release semantics. When an acquire reads the value written by this, this "
"thread's prior writes become visible to the acquiring thread. Prior "
"reads/writes within the same block cannot be reordered after this "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"发布语义（Release）。当获取（acquire）操作读取到由此操作写入的值时，本线程此前的写操作会对获取线程可见。同一 block "
"内先前的读/写操作不能被重排到此操作之后。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryOrder.ACQ_REL:1 of
msgid "Combined acquire and release semantics."
msgstr "组合的获取与发布（acquire-release）语义。"

#: ../../source/memory_model.rst:38
msgid "Memory Scope"
msgstr "内存作用域"

#: cuda.tile._memory_model.MemoryScope:1 of
msgid "The scope of threads that participate in memory ordering."
msgstr "参与内存排序的线程作用域范围。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryScope.NONE:1 of
msgid "No memory scope. Used for load/store operations with WEAK memory ordering."
msgstr "无内存作用域。用于采用 WEAK 内存序的 load/store 操作。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryScope.BLOCK:1 of
msgid "Ordering guarantees apply to threads within the same block."
msgstr "排序保证仅适用于同一 block 内的线程。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryScope.CLUSTER:1 of
msgid ""
"Ordering guarantees apply to all threads within the same thread-block "
"cluster. cuda.lang only."
msgstr "排序保证适用于同一线程块簇（thread-block cluster）内的所有线程。仅限 cuda.lang。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryScope.DEVICE:1 of
msgid "Ordering guarantees apply to all threads on the same GPU."
msgstr "排序保证适用于同一块 GPU 上的所有线程。"

#: ../../../docstring
#: cuda.tile.MemoryScope.SYS:1 of
msgid ""
"Ordering guarantees apply to all threads across the entire system, "
"including multiple GPUs and the host."
msgstr "排序保证适用于整个系统中的所有线程，包括多块 GPU 与主机。"

